    {
      "id": "public-transit-02-q1-question",
      "contentId": "public-transit-02-q1",
      "role": "question",
      "language": "en-US",
      "text": "You’re at the station. How would you ask where to enter the subway?",
      "cacheKey": "cb33f6c4e12e420e8630436ae24e89746b8621d028986bd5ad6f03aad650e4f0",
      "file": "audio/cache/cb33f6c4e12e420e8630436ae24e89746b8621d028986bd5ad6f03aad650e4f0.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "public-transit-02-q1-answer",
      "contentId": "public-transit-02-q1",
      "role": "answer",
      "language": "ko-KR",
      "text": "지하철 입구가 어디예요?",
      "cacheKey": "162464c2572344e64a3170ebb4b0b690c7b0f1dfcf2ed3a2b84cc9f3e31acd76",
      "file": "audio/cache/162464c2572344e64a3170ebb4b0b690c7b0f1dfcf2ed3a2b84cc9f3e31acd76.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "public-transit-02-q1-explanation",
      "contentId": "public-transit-02-q1",
      "role": "explanation",
      "language": "en-US",
      "text": "This asks where the subway entrance is. Use this polite question pattern when you need to locate a place.",
      "cacheKey": "0ad75ffe3909a38553e9f13814529980791939521f07522b6eb3456dfad6dae4",
      "file": "audio/cache/0ad75ffe3909a38553e9f13814529980791939521f07522b6eb3456dfad6dae4.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "public-transit-02-q2-question",
      "contentId": "public-transit-02-q2",
      "role": "question",
      "language": "en-US",
      "text": "You’re ready to board, but need directions. What would you ask?",
      "cacheKey": "43e555d64dba5b88c599d834c68ecf67c3e12be555a41e39fb739d260de0aa43",
      "file": "audio/cache/43e555d64dba5b88c599d834c68ecf67c3e12be555a41e39fb739d260de0aa43.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "public-transit-02-q2-answer",
      "contentId": "public-transit-02-q2",
      "role": "answer",
      "language": "ko-KR",
      "text": "승강장은 어디예요?",
      "cacheKey": "a26825b93da6ad9111da21019eaf649da97051d2fda9965607340ab04f6043bb",
      "file": "audio/cache/a26825b93da6ad9111da21019eaf649da97051d2fda9965607340ab04f6043bb.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "public-transit-02-q2-explanation",
      "contentId": "public-transit-02-q2",
      "role": "explanation",
      "language": "en-US",
      "text": "This asks where the platform is. The ending is a polite way to ask about the location of a place.",
      "cacheKey": "cf86ceff13e987039b3d119a6b94b417b57657cd5c30b6caf8911c63d4d6b3b1",
      "file": "audio/cache/cf86ceff13e987039b3d119a6b94b417b57657cd5c30b6caf8911c63d4d6b3b1.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "public-transit-02-q3-question",
      "contentId": "public-transit-02-q3",
      "role": "question",
      "language": "en-US",
      "text": "You need a ticket before traveling. What would you ask the station worker?",
      "cacheKey": "8b6cf5450e8b56d581cc1f1c2c04df626d670451071173fe6755e1268050c374",
      "file": "audio/cache/8b6cf5450e8b56d581cc1f1c2c04df626d670451071173fe6755e1268050c374.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "public-transit-02-q3-answer",
      "contentId": "public-transit-02-q3",
      "role": "answer",
      "language": "ko-KR",
      "text": "표는 어디에서 사요?",
      "cacheKey": "69e8dbd5746c64e4cc2b0478808b7358b47fc30209d24f8a6eb6b51a5447f036",
      "file": "audio/cache/69e8dbd5746c64e4cc2b0478808b7358b47fc30209d24f8a6eb6b51a5447f036.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "public-transit-02-q3-explanation",
      "contentId": "public-transit-02-q3",
      "role": "explanation",
      "language": "en-US",
      "text": "This asks where you can buy a ticket. The verb here means “buy,” so it’s useful when asking where to purchase something.",
      "cacheKey": "fc974cbb961a8e7d52803bf43e8f1385a830b0ca27d878a1a63e74e7346568d5",
      "file": "audio/cache/fc974cbb961a8e7d52803bf43e8f1385a830b0ca27d878a1a63e74e7346568d5.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "public-transit-02-q4-question",
      "contentId": "public-transit-02-q4",
      "role": "question",
      "language": "en-US",
      "text": "You’re not sure about the destination. How would you check where this train goes?",
      "cacheKey": "badea4f28611ae865d6f1db8d5d117b0a340646eb9514c8183475ca63553416b",
      "file": "audio/cache/badea4f28611ae865d6f1db8d5d117b0a340646eb9514c8183475ca63553416b.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "public-transit-02-q4-answer",
      "contentId": "public-transit-02-q4",
      "role": "answer",
      "language": "ko-KR",
      "text": "이 열차는 서울역에 가요?",
      "cacheKey": "041daaeb3c0d57a404b8622547e14dccc2db1d328b5da8ebc9fe48559fc341d0",
      "file": "audio/cache/041daaeb3c0d57a404b8622547e14dccc2db1d328b5da8ebc9fe48559fc341d0.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "public-transit-02-q4-explanation",
      "contentId": "public-transit-02-q4",
      "role": "explanation",
      "language": "en-US",
      "text": "This asks whether the train goes to Seoul Station. The particle after a place name can mark the destination.",
      "cacheKey": "9e375257a8510bf46f2bd71717e82bc7eabf8ee9980fd65a685ce623d34b47ff",
      "file": "audio/cache/9e375257a8510bf46f2bd71717e82bc7eabf8ee9980fd65a685ce623d34b47ff.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "public-transit-02-q5-question",
      "contentId": "public-transit-02-q5",
      "role": "question",
      "language": "en-US",
      "text": "You need to change trains along the way. How would you ask which station to use?",
      "cacheKey": "993d041537927e1e2620975c7e1dec250c782b96445be8d1675d582d49b3e33e",
      "file": "audio/cache/993d041537927e1e2620975c7e1dec250c782b96445be8d1675d582d49b3e33e.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "public-transit-02-q5-answer",
      "contentId": "public-transit-02-q5",
      "role": "answer",
      "language": "ko-KR",
      "text": "어느 역에서 갈아타요?",
      "cacheKey": "d3d4980acdacaa5f9c937926ada38d0fbc62bf494df599f73189b7d5a6d703f7",
      "file": "audio/cache/d3d4980acdacaa5f9c937926ada38d0fbc62bf494df599f73189b7d5a6d703f7.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "public-transit-02-q5-explanation",
      "contentId": "public-transit-02-q5",
      "role": "explanation",
      "language": "en-US",
      "text": "This asks which station you should transfer at. The verb means to change from one train to another.",
      "cacheKey": "74c1d7cc3e33fa3f5b3c771d167c9ec980a701d8de0543d831ae59b1d66d240f",
      "file": "audio/cache/74c1d7cc3e33fa3f5b3c771d167c9ec980a701d8de0543d831ae59b1d66d240f.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
